# Keeps the build context small (~16 MB) and stops host artefacts from leaking into the image.
#
# Note what is NOT excluded: `static/`. The six vendored game builds live there and are served as
# static assets — excluding it would 404 every Play button. `package-lock.json` and `.npmrc` are
# likewise required (see Dockerfile).

.git
.github
node_modules

# Build output — regenerated inside the image; a host copy would only shadow it.
.svelte-kit
build
.vercel
.netlify
.wrangler
.output

# Local-only
.verify
.env
.env.*
.vscode
.cursor
.bob
.claude
.mcp.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Not needed at build time. Root-scoped (`/*.md`, not `*.md`) so `static/sounds/README.md` still
# ships — the served static tree should be byte-identical to what Vercel serves.
/*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
Caddyfile
